      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Stephenson et al.",
        "AbstractText": "We describe the draft genome sequence of \"Candidatus Methylomonas sp. LWB\" isolated from Movile Cave microbial mat samples. The genome contains both the soluble and particular methane monooxygenase; however, one of the putative particulate methane monooxygenase gene clusters is ordered pmoABC rather than in the canonical gene arrangement of pmoCAB."
      },
